<title>UK: Great Portland yr pretax drops 3.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Great Portland yr pretax drops 3.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)(adjusted)   10.0		   vs 9.5</p>
<p> Shr (pence) (basic)     10.4		   vs 10.6</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)  9.0		    vs 9.0</p>
<p> Pretax profit	     46.03		  vs 47.62</p>
<p>Pretax before sale of</p>
<p>   investment props	44.8		   vs 44.0</p>
<p> Net asset value/shr (p) 212		    vs 197</p>
<p> Net rental income	 96.17		  vs 94.6</p>
<p>NOTE - The adjusted earnings per share figure takes into account a 97 million stg rights issue in February 1997. Full name of the British property and investment group is Great Portland Estates Plc.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
